# test/.cache — THIS BOX'S OWN NOTES, AND THEY MUST NOT TRAVEL.
#
# Two files land here and neither is a fact about the repo:
#
#   gates-check.json   the content hash of the tree that last PASSED
#                      `nukernel/gates-extract.js --check` on this machine,
#                      with this node. Committing it would let one person's
#                      pass skip everybody else's check — a cache that can
#                      return a stale green is worse than no cache at all.
#   durations.json     what each gate cost last time, used only to start the
#                      long poles first. A hint about a box, not about a gate.
#
# Both are rebuilt by running the suite. Delete this whole folder any time;
# the next run is simply slower.
*
!.gitignore
